  "scope": "Exact 2024–25 Smarter Balanced/SBAC definitions in California statewide and Los Angeles Unified, Delaware, Nevada statewide and Clark County, and Washington. District bindings use their audited state's verified assessment system, tested grades, standards and year; population models remain separate.",
  "limitations": "A consortium developer is distinct from a legal assessment owner or a state delivery contractor. Those roles remain unaudited. Interim reliability or validity findings are not transferred to summative models. No additional state or assessment family is approved by membership, and no threshold ambition comparison is established.",
